# ── Dependencies ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Restorable with `cd game && npm install`. esbuild alone is ~10MB of
# platform-specific binaries; it does not belong in history.
game/node_modules/

# ── Secrets — nothing matching these has ever existed here ──
# Preventive only. The Anthropic API key for the broadcast lives in the
# browser's localStorage and MUST NEVER be written to a file in this repo.
# See game/README.md § API key (Gate B): a keyed build is for local use
# only and is not safe to distribute.
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
secrets.json
credentials.json
**/apikey*
**/api-key*

# ── Machine-local Claude Code settings ──────────────────────
# Per-machine permission grants with absolute Windows paths. Personal to
# one checkout, not useful to anyone else. A shared .claude/settings.json
# (no ".local") would be committed — there isn't one today.
.claude/settings.local.json

# ── OS / editor cruft ───────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/

# ── Logs ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
npm-debug.log*
*.log


# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# DELIBERATELY *NOT* IGNORED — do not "clean this up"
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# game/dist/app.js  — the built bundle IS the deliverable. The whole
#   distribution promise is: unzip, double-click index.html, play — with
#   no build step. Ignoring it breaks that for anyone who clones or
#   downloads a zip of this repo. Rebuild with `cd game && npm run build`
#   after changing anything under game/src/ or model/, and commit the
#   result alongside the source change.
#
# game/package-lock.json — pinned dependency tree; keeps `npm install`
#   reproducible.
